dd-5538\">\n                            Download                        <\/button>\n                        <div class=\"archive__dropdown-menu\"\n                             role=\"menu\"\n                             id=\"archive-dd-5538\"\n                             aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                                            <a class=\"archive__dropdown-item\" href=\"https:\/\/speeches.byu.edu\/wp-content\/uploads\/mp3\/Romney_Marion_0619711.mp3\" role=\"menuitem\" download>MP3<\/a>\n                                                        <span class=\"archive__dropdown-separator\">|<\/span>\n                                                            <span class=\"archive__dropdown-item archive__dropdown-item--unavailable\" role=\"menuitem\" aria-disabled=\"true\">PDF<\/span>\n                                                    <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n                                    <div class=\"archive__card-tags\">\n                                                    <span class=\"archive__tag\">Devotional<\/span>\n                                                                            <span class=\"archive__tag\">Eternal Life<\/span>\n                                                    <span class=\"archive__tag\">Testimony<\/span>\n                                            <\/div>\n                            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/article>\n    <hr class=\"archive__separator\">\n        <article class=\"archive__card\" itemscope itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\">\n        <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Doing the Right Things for the Right Reasons\">\n        <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"https:\/\/speeches.byu.edu\/talks\/harold-b-lee\/right-things-right-reasons\/\">\n                    <meta itemprop=\"description\" content=\"It isn&#039;t enough to be doing the right things; we need to make sure we are doing them for the right reasons. Ask yourself, &quot;Are my motives pure?&quot; The text\u2026\">\n                            <meta itemprop=\"genre\" content=\"Devotional\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"about\" content=\"Agency\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"about\" content=\"Morality\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"about\" content=\"Righteousness\">\n                    <a class=\"archive__card-link-overlay\"\n           href=\"https:\/\/speeches.byu.edu\/talks\/harold-b-lee\/right-things-right-reasons\/\"\n           aria-label=\"Read speech: Doing the Right Things for the Right Reasons\"><\/a>\n\n        <div class=\"archive__card-left\">\n            <div class=\"archive__card-image\">\n                <img class=\"archive__card-portrait\" src=\"https:\/\/speeches.byu.edu\/wp-content\/uploads\/jpg\/Lee_Harold_B-Web-compressor.jpg\" alt=\"Harold B. Lee - Mormon Prophet and Apostle\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"low\" width=\"260\" height=\"333\" nopin=\"nopin\" sizes=\"(max-width: 260px) 100vw, 260px\">            <\/div>\n\n            <div class=\"archive__card-content\">\n                                                    <p class=\"archive__card-byline\"><span itemprop=\"author\" itemscope itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/Person\"><a class=\"archive__card-name\" href=\"https:\/\/speeches.byu.edu\/speakers\/harold-b-lee\/\" rel=\"author\" itemprop=\"url\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Harold B. Lee<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n                                <p class=\"archive__card-title\">Doing the Right Things for the Right Reasons<\/p>\n                                    <div class=\"archive__card-meta\">\n                                                    <time class=\"archive__card-date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\" datetime=\"1961-04-19\">19 Apr 1961<\/time>\n                                                                            <span class=\"archive__card-views\">2k views<\/span>\n                                            <\/div>\n                                                    <p class=\"archive__card-excerpt\">It isn&#039;t enough to be doing the right things; we need to make sure we are doing them for the right reasons. Ask yourself, &quot;Are my motives pure?&quot; The text\u2026<\/p>\n                                <div class=\"archive__card-media-links\">\n                                            <span class=\"archive__media-link archive__media-link--unavailable\">Video<\/span>\n                                        <span class=\"archive__media-separator\">|<\/span>\n                                            <a href=\"https:\/\/speeches.byu.edu\/talks\/harold-b-lee\/right-things-right-reasons\/?M=A\" class=\"archive__media-link\">\n                            Audio                        <\/a>\n                                        <span class=\"archive__media-separator\">|<\/span>\n                                            <a href=\"https:\/\/speeches.byu.edu\/talks\/harold-b-lee\/right-things-right-reasons\/\" class=\"archive__media-link\">\n                            Text                        <\/a>\n                                        <span class=\"archive__media-separator\">|<\/span>\n                                        <div class=\"archive__download\">\n                        <button type=\"button\"\n                                class=\"archive__media-link archive__media-link--download archive__dropdown-trigger\"\n                                aria-expanded=\"false\"\n                                aria-haspopup=\"true\"\n                                aria-controls=\"archive-dd-5815\">\n                            Download                        <\/button>\n                        <div class=\"archive__dropdown-menu\"\n                             role=\"menu\"\n                             id=\"archive-dd-5815\"\n                             aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                                            <a class=\"archive__dropdown-item\" href=\"https:\/\/speeches.byu.edu\/wp-content\/uploads\/mp3\/Lee61.mp3\" role=\"menuitem\" download>MP3<\/a>\n                                                        <span class=\"archive__dropdown-separator\">|<\/span>\n                                                            <span class=\"archive__dropdown-item archive__dropdown-item--unavailable\" role=\"menuitem\" aria-disabled=\"true\">PDF<\/span>\n                                                    <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n                                    <div class=\"archive__card-tags\">\n                                                    <span class=\"archive__tag\">Devotional<\/span>\n                                                                            <span class=\"archive__tag\">Agency<\/span>\n                                                    <span class=\"archive__tag\">Morality<\/span>\n                                                    <span class=\"archive__tag\">Righteousness<\/span>\n                                            <\/div>\n                            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/article>\n    <hr class=\"archive__separator\">\n        <article class=\"archive__card\" itemscope itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\">\n        <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Grow Toward Christ\">\n        <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"https:\/\/speeches.byu.edu\/talks\/barbara-a-heise\/grow-toward-christ\/\">\n                    <meta itemprop=\"description\" content=\"We don\u2019t have to be perfect\u2014after all we can do, the Savior does the rest. When we repent we choose to be changed, to be spiritually stronger, and to come closer to the Savior.\">\n                            <meta itemprop=\"genre\" content=\"Devotional\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"about\" content=\"Jesus Christ\">\n                    <a class=\"archive__card-link-overlay\"\n           hr